OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after Sean Graham    
OL,4,Abookmakers memorial vandalised again   
OL,6,FAn 18-year-old man has been arrested   
OL,7,Fafter a memorial to those killed in the
OL,8,FSean Graham bookmakers attack was      
OL,9,Fvandalised for the third time in as    
OL,10,Fmany months.                           
OL,12,FFive people were murdered in the Ulster
OL,13,FDefence Association (UDA) attack on the
OL,14,FOrmeau Road in south Belfast in 1992.  
OL,15,FSeven other people were injured.       
OL,17,FPaint was thrown over a plaque         
OL,18,Fdedicated to the victims in the early  
OL,19,Fhours of Friday morning. Police are    
OL,20,Ftreating the attack as a               
OL,21,F"sectarian-motivated hate crime".      
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
