OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after Sean Graham    
OL,4,Abookmakers memorial vandalised again   
OL,6,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland 
OL,7,F(PSNI) said the man was arrested on    
OL,8,FFriday on "suspicion of three counts of
OL,9,Fcriminal damage relating to incidents  
OL,10,Freported to have occurred between      
OL,11,FSeptember and November of this year".  
